[32m+ [m
[32m+ ## 2. Developer Guide — Smart Contract[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 2.1 Contract Overview[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ `AssetTokenization.sol` is a Solidity 0.8.20 ERC-20 compatible contract that represents fractional ownership of a real-estate asset.[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **Key properties:**[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Property | Type | Description |[m
[32m+ |----------|------|-------------|[m
[32m+ | `name` | string | Token name |[m
[32m+ | `symbol` | string | Token symbol |[m
[32m+ | `totalSupply` | uint256 (immutable) | Total token supply = `fractionCount * 10^18` |[m
[32m+ | `issuerReserve` | uint256 (immutable) | Reserve held by deployer |[m
[32m+ | `owner` | address | Contract admin |[m
[32m+ | `treasury` | address | Sale treasury address |[m
[32m+ | `assetValuation` | uint256 | Current asset valuation |[m
[32m+ | `transfersRestricted` | bool | Global transfer restriction flag (default true) |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 2.2 Constructor Parameters[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ```solidity[m
[32m+ constructor([m
[32m+     string memory tokenName,        // e.g. "Singapore Real Estate Token"[m
[32m+     string memory tokenSymbol,      // e.g. "SRET"[m
[32m+     uint256 fractionCount,          // e.g. 10000[m
[32m+     address saleTreasury,           // treasury address for investor tokens[m
[32m+     uint16 issuerReserveBps,        // issuer reserve in basis points (0-10000)[m
[32m+     uint256 initialAssetValuation,  // e.g. 10000000[m
[32m+     string memory initialCurrencyCode, // e.g. "SGD"[m
[32m+     string memory initialAssetUri,  // metadata URI[m
[32m+     uint256 initialVotingPeriod,    // in seconds (minimum 1 hour)[m
[32m+     uint256 initialQuorumBps        // quorum in basis points (0-10000)[m
[32m+ )[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **Token distribution on deployment:**[m
[32m+ - `issuerReserve = (totalSupply * issuerReserveBps) / 10000`[m
[32m+ - Deployer receives `issuerReserve` tokens[m
[32m+ - Treasury receives `totalSupply - issuerReserve` tokens[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 2.3 Core Functions[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Token Transfers[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Function | Signature | Notes |[m
[32m+ |----------|-----------|-------|[m
[32m+ | `transfer` | `(address to, uint256 value) -> bool` | Standard ERC-20 transfer |[m
[32m+ | `approve` | `(address spender, uint256 value) -> bool` | Sets spender allowance |[m
[32m+ | `transferFrom` | `(address from, address to, uint256 value) -> bool` | Requires prior approval |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **Transfer restrictions:** When `transfersRestricted` is true, either the `from` or `to` address must be in the `transferAllowed` mapping. The owner controls this via `setTransferAllowed(address account, bool allowed)` and `setTransfersRestricted(bool)`.[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **During active governance proposals**, all transfers are blocked (`require(activeProposalCount == 0)`).[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Token Information[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Function | Description |[m
[32m+ |----------|-------------|[m
[32m+ | `tokenPrice()` | Returns `assetValuation / totalFractions` |[m
[32m+ | `investorSupply()` | Returns `totalSupply - issuerReserve` |[m
[32m+ | `quorumVotes()` | Returns `(totalSupply * quorumBps) / 10000` |[m
[32m+ | `balanceOf(address)` | Returns token balance |[m
[32m+ | `allowance(address owner, address spender)` | Returns allowance |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Governance[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Function | Signature | Required Role | Description |[m
[32m+ |----------|-----------|---------------|-------------|[m
[32m+ | `propose` | `(string description, bytes32 executionDataHash) -> uint256 proposalId` | Token holder (balance > 0) | Create a proposal with a voting period of `votingPeriod` seconds |[m
[32m+ | `castVote` | `(uint256 proposalId, bool support)` | Token holder (balance > 0) | Vote for or against a proposal; weight = caller's balance |[m
[32m+ | `executeProposal` | `(uint256 proposalId) -> bool passed` | Anyone | Execute after voting ends; passes if `forVotes > againstVotes` and total votes >= quorum |[m
[32m+ | `cancelProposal` | `(uint256 proposalId)` | Owner or proposer | Cancel a pending proposal |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Admin Functions (owner only)[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Function | Description |[m
[32m+ |----------|-------------|[m
[32m+ | `setTransferAllowed(address, bool)` | Allow/deny specific address transfers |[m
[32m+ | `setTransfersRestricted(bool)` | Toggle global transfer restriction |[m
[32m+ | `updateTreasury(address)` | Change treasury address |[m
[32m+ | `updateAssetValuation(uint256, string)` | Update valuation and currency |[m
[32m+ | `updateAssetUri(string)` | Update metadata URI |[m
[32m+ | `updateGovernanceSettings(uint256, uint256)` | Update voting period and quorum |[m
[32m+ | `transferOwnership(address)` | Transfer contract ownership |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 2.4 Events[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ The contract emits standard ERC-20 events plus governance events:[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ``+Transfer, Approval, OwnershipTransferred, TreasuryUpdated,[m
[32m+ TransferPolicyUpdated, TransferAllowedUpdated, AssetValuationUpdated,[m
[32m+ AssetUriUpdated, ProposalCreated, VoteCast, ProposalExecuted, ProposalCanceled``[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 2.5 Compilation and Validation[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ From `backend/contracts/`:[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ```bash[m
[32m+ # Compile and validate the contract[m
[32m+ node scripts/validateSmartContract.js[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ # Deploy (requires environment configuration)[m
[32m+ # See Environment Configuration section[m
[32m+ npm run deploy[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ The `validateSmartContract.js` script verifies:[m
[32m+ - The contract compiles without Solidity errors[m
[32m+ - Bytecode is non-empty[m
[32m+ - The ABI exposes all required function names[m
[32m+ - The ABI exposes all required event names[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ---[m
