[32m+ ## 3. Developer Guide — Backend API[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 3.1 Base URL[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ http://localhost:3000/api    (development)[m
[32m+ https://api.example.com/api   (production)[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ All endpoints return JSON with `{ success, data, message }` or `{ success, errors, message }` structure.[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 3.2 Authentication[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ Authentication uses JWT bearer tokens. Include the token in the `Authorization` header:[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ Authorization: Bearer <token>[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ Tokens are signed with `JWT_SECRET` and expire after `JWT_EXPIRES_IN` (default 7 days). The JWT payload contains `{ id, email, role }`.[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ ### 3.3 API Endpoints[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Authentication (`/api/auth`)[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ | Method | Path | Auth | Description |[m
[32m+ |--------|------|------|-------------|[m
[32m+ | POST | `/api/auth/register` | None | Create a new user account |[m
[32m+ | POST | `/api/auth/login` | None | Authenticate and receive JWT |[m
[32m+ | GET | `/api/auth/profile` | Bearer | Get current user profile |[m
[32m+ | PUT | `/api/auth/profile` | Bearer | Update profile fields |[m
[32m+ | POST | `/api/auth/logout` | Bearer | Client-side logout (stateless JWT) |[m
[32m+ | PUT | `/api/auth/language` | Bearer | Change preferred language |[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **Register:**[m
[32m+ ```json[m
[32m+ Request:[m
[32m+ POST /api/auth/register[m
[32m+ {[m
[32m+   "username": "alice",[m
[32m+   "email": "alice@example.com",[m
[32m+   "password": "securepassword",[m
[32m+   "fullName": "Alice Lee"[m
[32m+ }[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ Response:[m
[32m+ {[m
[32m+   "success": true,[m
[32m+   "message": "User registered successfully",[m
[32m+   "data": { "user": { ... }, "token": "eyJhbGc..." }[m
[32m+ }[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **Login:**[m
[32m+ ```json[m
[32m+ Request:[m
[32m+ POST /api/auth/login[m
[32m+ {[m
[32m+   "email": "alice@example.com",[m
[32m+   "password": "securepassword"[m
[32m+ }[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ Response:[m
[32m+ {[m
[32m+   "success": true,[m
[32m+   "message": "Login successful",[m
[32m+   "data": { "user": { ... }, "token": "eyJhbGc..." }[m
[32m+ }[m
[32m+ ```[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ **User Roles:**[m
[32m+ - `user`: default role[m
[32m+ - `investor`: can invest in tokens[m
[32m+ - `seller`: can list assets[m
[32m+ - `admin`: administrative access[m
[32m+ - `superadmin`: highest access level[m
[32m+ [m
[32m+ #### Tokenization (`/api/tokens`)[m
